  // A 14-inch portable television standing on the cart's left (x -0.15): a 370 by 330 mm cabinet 220 mm deep with the
  // tube's housing behind it, rabbit ears on top. The picture (screen 2) is 256 by 210 mm, centred 25 mm left of the
  // cabinet's centre and 191 mm above the cart, on the tube's dark glass inside a silver mask ring; the right-hand
